<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-26T20:40:34.465Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 20:40:34 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen attacked civilians in Plateau, killing a 60-year-old woman harvesting groundnuts and injuring two farmers, while Fulani attackers killed a farmer and wounded another. In Taraba, bandits killed dozens of villagers, with reports of 52 bodies buried and later 58 bodies recovered from a market attack. Bandits also struck near Sokoto University, prompting police confirmation of the assault. Northern senators have demanded the arrest and prosecution of the perpetrators of the Taraba attacks. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNTnRKbF9zaV91aVhVa2paT1A3TTRBZFBsaThqenNjcVJYZFpJcVNGUVdybkVDZk81U2dEVENHekVZMUZjODBld3MtZnJfenhvWE9zSFlLMmM2UUdmVTdKMzhZTHRrTDU5NXFNdXowSXFiNUFkSklodjN5a2d6Rk0tTGl6UEtkcUMzOV9NalhRVFNJcC1RMjducjl1VmJNZHBjdlZNNThXTW9SMkJvbWljNkh3?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxPb0d6UDlNblo0cHJ3Sl85VDcyS09yWGRuWXRmVjZTS1lZdnh1d19uSnFyWmE0SmwxZVRqcEM1a3psWm1LX2xnaVhmYmMyQUR6RnJkWk9obDRrVk1pWExfMTNBTFhKYkN5cTlWbmVPdk5PZHQxM2xjUno3WXlQbVV0M2pmZDFnTzZVVzlpWkYwWmJxU2tz?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxNUVZvN2xCa3Y3NEdXeUlNOU13SVJKT3k2d0tQbnhvNnlpWm9LYjFVUVpCbVQ5TDFZdGNHU0dyb2dveHdCS2NFRzh5LWNZNTZZZG9QSXIwU1czc05aTlFNZ3FDQWFWY2FiNFNXZzRiWUt1dG10QW8wWHZsRXlneWtGemNxMmF4R1k3ejFrZktLWFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Truth Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE40SWxzZV9fRV9fQ3JGaUdGSjhHZkJ3ZjJGaTJrakM2ZzZOSHpadDVBUlJhb0swTzBhUm5FSk5wbl84UUxFd3JiS0Q1LXdsTGxrRHM2cHM4UUt5NXRGZ3JFS0RYQzZQVlZTMk5rak9id3RvSG0yUDdwU0dzSzlzSFk?oc=5&quot;&gt;CBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/arti